      <script name="schema:software-application" type="application/ld+json">
        {"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SoftwareApplication","name":"Yalla - Play Game &amp; Voice Chat","description":"Play, Chat, and Connect – All in One Place!\nLooking for a fun, engaging way to play games and chat with friends? Yalla brings together casual games and voice chat rooms, creating an unmatched social experience. Whether you're a fan of classic games or love connecting with new people, we’ve got you covered!\n\nKey Features:\nCasual Games to Enjoy Anytime\n- Play popular games like Ludo, Carrom, UMO, and Baloot with friends or other players worldwide.\n- Immerse yourself in friendly competitions, challenge players worldwide, and climb the leaderboards to prove your skills.\n- Stay tuned—more exciting games are coming soon!\n\nVoice Chat Rooms\n- Join voice chat rooms to talk, laugh, and make new friends. Thousands of voice chat rooms are waiting for you.\n- Go on the mic, send messages in chat, or exchange virtual gifts to enhance the fun.\n- Play mini-games directly in the room for a lively group experience.\n\n1-on-1 Private Chat\n- Connect deeper with friends through private chat. Share messages, voice notes, and more in a personal space.\n\nPost and Share\n- Share your thoughts, game achievements, or fun moments with the community posts feature. Let others know what you're up to!\n\nWhy Choose Our App?\n- All-in-One Experience: Play games, chat, and socialize in one seamless app.\n- Global Community: Meet and interact with people from around the world.\n- Fun and Interactive: Voice chat, gifts, and games make every moment exciting.\n\nFollow us to get the latest news, updates and events:\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/YallaVoiceChatRooms\nWebsite: www.yalla.live\nDear YALLA users, your feedback and suggestions are welcome to: yallasupport@yalla.com","screenshot":["https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/9c/43/65/9c4365de-5c06-052f-7fe0-eba425535f69/en-1.jpg/300x0w.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/bb/ea/8a/bbea8a46-ff58-0e45-1263-1623b9b638f1/2b6271a5-730b-42a6-8cdb-8e503c4c11a8_en-2.jpg/300x0w.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/88/1b/ca/881bca9a-05e9-89f2-b5cd-97f24e9256cc/en-2.jpg/300x0w.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/ba/4a/fb/ba4afb8d-3ca0-08f7-dccd-27bfa08bce16/en-3.jpg/300x0w.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/d6/1a/35/d61a3511-daa3-578a-6996-06c9cee36ae4/en-4.jpg/300x0w.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/4a/6e/41/4a6e41b5-030b-b2a5-6dcc-b94d134aa48c/en-5.jpg/300x0w.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/e7/95/5c/e7955cac-d968-10f4-dfc9-1f5914197207/a00c086a-ef5e-4a33-9a7c-e34013d1cc15__U82f1_U8bed.jpg/300x0w.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/c7/b4/98/c7b4986b-1132-cff5-e2ca-a2a1370f3449/4b6ca097-e775-4316-af46-15afa7cec6aa_en-1.jpg/300x0w.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/79/af/ac/79afacf2-26bd-ede6-20de-61da49f80591/49983b1e-b7fb-453f-b586-46759093c5b6_en-3.jpg/300x0w.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/7b/40/a3/7b40a3f0-ace8-ef9a-d9ea-7aaff511d5f1/7cfe4dea-b800-4097-b816-ec75e7a8c92d_en-5.jpg/300x0w.jpg"],"image":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/78/2c/79/782c79dc-bbd7-d447-812e-627d45d8ddb4/AppIcon-Yalla-0-0-1x_U007ephone-0-1-0-sRGB-85-220.png/1200x630wa.png","applicationCategory":"Entertainment","datePublished":"Apr 19, 2016","operatingSystem":"Requires iOS 13.0 or later. Compatible with iPhone, iPad, and iPod touch.","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Yalla Technology FZ-LLC","url":"https://apps.apple.com/us/developer/yalla-technology-fz-llc/id1444567250"},"aggregateRating":{"@type":"AggregateRating","ratingValue":4.2,"reviewCount":7792},"offers":{"@type":"Offer","price":0,"priceCurrency":"USD","category":"free"}}
      </script>

