    <h3 class="we-truncate we-truncate--single-line  we-customer-review__title" dir="ltr" id="we-customer-review-102">
    A big shout-out to yalla
</h3>



      <blockquote class="we-truncate we-truncate--multi-line we-truncate--interactive  we-customer-review__body" dir>
        

        <p dir="false" data-test-bidi>I’ve been using this app for a good amount of time , my experience has been superb so far👌👌. After joining in yalla,  everyone welcomed me like a family and I became one of them eventually. Here, I’ve been talking to different people, making friends, playing games , earning gifts and doing many other lucrative  activities. This app has made my online time worthwhile. ❤️❤️</p>
    


<!----></blockquote>



      <h3 class="we-customer-review__header we-customer-review__header--response">
          <span class="we-truncate we-truncate--single-line  we-customer-review__title" dir="ltr">
