</span>



        <span class="we-customer-review__separator">, </span>

        
      </h3>

        <blockquote class="we-truncate we-truncate--multi-line we-truncate--interactive  we-customer-review__body" dir>
        

        <p dir="false" data-test-bidi>Hello dear! We are happy to be with you in Yalla. Yalla is an original application that allows you to meet new friends from around the Arab world. We hope that your next comment will also be five stars. If you have suggestions, you can contact yallasupport@yalla.live.</p>
    


