</span>



    <span class="we-customer-review__separator">, </span>

    <time data-test-customer-review-date datetime="2019-06-08T15:22:46.000Z" aria-label="June 8, 2019" class="we-customer-review__date" >06/08/2019</time>
  </div>

    <h3 class="we-truncate we-truncate--single-line  we-customer-review__title" dir id="we-customer-review-103">
    Unprofessional
</h3>



      <blockquote class="we-truncate we-truncate--multi-line we-truncate--interactive  we-customer-review__body" dir>
        

        <p dir="false" data-test-bidi>If you asked questions nobody would answer, they would just say random things over and over again. The viewers would just do nothing. If I asked if they were real there would be not 1 comment. If there was a comment it wasn’t even related to what I was talking about. I don’t recommend getting this app.</p>
    


<!----></blockquote>



