    <h3 class="we-truncate we-truncate--single-line  we-customer-review__title" dir="ltr" id="we-customer-review-104">
    yalla is my favourite app since last few months..
</h3>



      <blockquote class="we-truncate we-truncate--multi-line we-truncate--interactive  we-customer-review__body" dir>
        

        <p dir="false" data-test-bidi>I’m using this app since last couple of months and I just forgot other apps for time pass. honestly I found a lot of good friends here and in party time I feel like I’m in a party house. just awesome. strongly recommending for all.... 😍😍</p>
    


