deo221/v4/57/a9/1c/57a91cc3-585e-57e8-42bc-479afbe58ad6/Job51025092-3822-4283-8b85-a1bd66852c12-164992504-PreviewImage_preview_image_nonvideo_sdr-Time1711019852601.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1080},\"video\":\"https://apptrailers.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/PurpleVideo211/v4/ab/80/1a/ab801a05-6189-fc47-eb15-5bf2eed3f2c1/P840187658_default.m3u8\"}]}}}},\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Beela Chat is a popular Group Voice Room and Entertaining Community. Online party and play games with others all over the world. Come and join an online party\\n\\nFEATURES:\\n\\n* VIRTUAL GIFTS\\nWe specially customize lots of awesome virtual gifts with effect and voice for you. We will continue to create more surprise for you.\\nSend it express your happiness with friends!\\n\u2028* FREE GROUP VOICE ROOMS\\nWe have many voice rooms around the world that cover different topics. Join a party room and start a party, have fun with your friends.\\nEnjoy free voice party over net!\\n\u2028* GAME CENTER\\nThere are various games in it, like: Ludo, Uno, Domino, Carrom and other games. With perfect and high-quality effect playing.\\nPlay games together directly in the party room!\\n\u2028*SHARE MOMENTS\\nYou can sharing every moment with photos or texts to express yourself and connect with friends.\\nConnect with friends, share what you're up to.\u2028\u2028Join Beela Chat now！ Create your own party room and enjoy in it！\"},\"editorialArtwork\":{\"brandLogo\":{\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"height\":1080,\"textColor1\":\"f2f2f2\",\"textColor2\":\"e5e5e5\",\"textColor3\":\"c1c1c1\",\"textColor4\":\"b7b7b7\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features116/v4/28/59/ee/2859eebe-20ac-7814-ec46-0fce7ce3d567/12fc09db-ce0f-4c5f-a841-6866788e0179.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1080},\"contentIconTrimmed\":{\"bgColor\":\"b6030c\",\"height\":1080,\"textColor1\":\"febc00\",\"textColor2\":\"febc00\",\"textColor3\":\"f09702\",\"textColor4\":\"f09702\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/ima