e your winning moment with your friends;\\r\\n4. Bug fixed.\\r\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-10-09T01:23:12Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.7\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2021-07-05\",\"releaseNotes\":\" 1. New game mode - Night Ludo: in Night Ludo, you can only see few parts of the board. So be careful of your opponents' moves;\\n 2. Updated Spectate function - turn on the live chat when you are spectating games;\\n 3. Added chat bubble in Messages - use your favorite chat bubbles when messaging your friends;\\n 4. Bug fixed.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-07-05T03:19:33Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.6\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2021-05-06\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Added single-mode in Team-up, you can team-up with strangers now;\\r\\n2. Other optimizations;\\r\\n3. Bugs fixed.\\r\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-05-06T01:30:33Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.5\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2021-04-05\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1.Added \\\"Team-up\\\" in Ludo: play Ludo with your friends;\\r\\n2.Added \\\"Message\\\" feature: send messages and emojis to your friends;\\r\\n3.Other optimizations;\\r\\n4.Bugs fixed. \",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-04-05T09:59:38Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.4.2\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2021-03-18\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1.Added \\\"Team-up\\\" in Ludo: play Ludo with your friends;\\r\\n2.Added \\\"Message\\\" feature: send messages and emojis to your friends;\\r\\n3.Other optimizations;\\r\\n4.Bugs fixed. \\r\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-03-18T06:48:03Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.4.1\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2021-01-05\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Fixed bugs\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-01-05T05:41:09Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.4\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2020-11-26\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1.Added Billionaire and Legend Star in Rank.\\n2.Added Chat Off in game, you will not receive other players’ text messages after turning it on. \\n3.Bug fixed.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2020-11-26T01:56:49Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.3\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2020-09-30\",\"releaseNotes\":null,\"releaseTimestamp\