-b6b53506d39c_1v1.jpg/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1242},{\"bgColor\":\"a63d2a\",\"height\":2688,\"textColor1\":\"fdf6b0\",\"textColor2\":\"e8ded9\",\"textColor3\":\"ecd195\",\"textColor4\":\"dbbeb6\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/76/e3/42/76e3427c-c9ab-0734-b2de-8508118469ca/35986bf2-c0fc-4ffd-aed0-acda45f2288a__U7ffb_U500d_U6a21_U5f0f.jpg/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1242},{\"bgColor\":\"8d4c2b\",\"height\":2688,\"textColor1\":\"f8f4c3\",\"textColor2\":\"fadaad\",\"textColor3\":\"e3d2a4\",\"textColor4\":\"e4bd93\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/06/07/73/06077383-bc87-0649-a07d-e9040618d25c/3ddef472-fcc8-4ad1-b7ed-7fb073b8e8b2__U6fc0_U52b1_U89c6_U9891.jpg/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1242},{\"bgColor\":\"8d4c2b\",\"height\":2688,\"textColor1\":\"f8f4c3\",\"textColor2\":\"ebd5c9\",\"textColor3\":\"e3d2a4\",\"textColor4\":\"d8baa9\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/18/df/43/18df43b5-4745-b3c6-9f0c-863374f3bb41/ed361af9-78d8-4d49-bc68-992aeb34f756__U9526_U6807_U8d5b.jpg/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1242},{\"bgColor\":\"131321\",\"height\":2688,\"textColor1\":\"9393e8\",\"textColor2\":\"e9644b\",\"textColor3\":\"7a7ac0\",\"textColor4\":\"bf5342\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/5a/44/84/5a44846a-8cc6-0d24-c974-eb0bb01d19bf/d710eb93-c694-4808-8779-01348e12d1db__U88c5_U626e.jpg/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1242}]},\"customVideoPreviewsByType\":{\"iphone6+\":[{\"previewFrame\":{\"bgColor\":\"cac8c8\",\"height\":1080,\"textColor1\":\"090f02\",\"textColor2\":\"2a293f\",\"textColor3\":\"30342a\",\"textColor4\":\"4a495a\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleVideo126/v4/e4/29/12/e4291264-dbb3-122a-05dc-67d5b3d722e9/Job6dec2d75-f918-4758-8d2d-d76a1f15d101-151639764-PreviewImage_preview_image_nonvideo_sdr-Time1687169917224.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1920},\"video\":\"https://apptrailers.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/PurpleVideo126/v4/f3/9f/29/f39f29ce-bf2f-a69f-18eb-6fb167053ae0/P591766022_default.m3u8\"}],\"iphone_6_5\":[{\"previewFrame\":{\"bgColor\":\"351612\",\"height\":886,\"textColor1\":\"f7ebda\",\"textColor2\":\"f0d9be\",\"textColor3\":\"d0c0b2\",\"textColor4\":\"cab29b\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleVideo221/v4/d9/56/62/d9566206-a298-bfac-a3bb-64bd28dfe1b8/Job7d7a7941-93d1-46f6-bc83-58f5dcdb8749-201401326-PreviewImage_Preview_Image_Intermediate_nonvideo_394105922_2312502796-Time1756376119702.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1920},\"video\":\"https://apptrailers.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/PurpleVideo211/v4/61/2f/ae/612fae34-505a-a8da-3877-d6a096d8a2f6/P1174108870_default.m3u8\"}]}}}},\"description\":{\"standard\":\"You can voice chat while playing games for free in 101 Okey Yalla, gaining more fun. Only in 101 Okey Yalla can you experience the same game atmosphere as the offline game.\\n\\n1. Free 101 Okey Game\\nExperience the classic 101 Okey game for free and battle with multiple players matched in real time.\\n\\n2. Real-Time Voice Chat\\nEnjoy real-time voice chat in the game scenes perfectly imitated as the real life. Offer you an easier way to make friends from all over the world.\\n\\n3. Self-Created Room\\nInvite friends to play together or team up to win the victory. Game modes can be chosen as you like: Team, multiple rounds, etc.\\n\\n4. In-Game Interaction\\nSend funny emojis to express your complement and collect free golds given by friends\\n\\n5. Plentiful Game Modes\\nTurbo mode: Experience the excitement of multiplying bets and win more free golds\\nLeague: Defeat the opponents to show your superb skills and realize your legend dream in 101 Okey Yalla! More gameplays are waiting for you to explore!\\n\\n101 Okey Yalla team will commit to creating a supreme game and social experience for you.\\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\\nIf you choose to subscribe to 101 Okey Yalla VIP, the purchase will be billed to your iTunes account. \\nYour iTunes account will be charged automatically for renewal within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period. \\nYou can manage and cancel your subscriptions at any time by going to your iTunes Account Settings after purchase.\\nCurrent 101 Okey Yalla VIP subscription price starts at 7.99 USD/month. Prices are in U.S. dollars, may vary in countries other than the U.S., and are subject to change without notice. \\nNo cancellation of the current subscription is allowed during the active subscription period. You could still have great fun in 101 Okey Yalla without becoming a 101 Okey Yalla VIP.\\n\\nWe will continue to give our best shot to provide you with more fun games which will enrich your daily life.\\n\\n\\nPrivacy Policy：https://www.yallaokey101.com/term/EN/TermOfService.html#PrivacyPolicy\\n\\nTerms of Service：https://www.yallaokey101.com/term/EN/TermOfService.html#TermsOfService\\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\\nNote: 101 Okey Yalla only offers online 101 Okey games for free and does not offer any form of real-money gambling or any in-kind rewards based on the games.\\n\\nFor more information or suggestions, please join our social media communities to get the latest game news!\\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/yallaokey/\\nİnstagram: https://www.instagram.com/yallaokey101/?igshid=YmMyMTA2M2Y=You can voice chat while playing games for free in 101 Okey Yalla, gaining more fun. Only in 101 Okey Yalla can you experience the same game atmosphere as the offline game.\"},\"editorialArtwork\":{\"bannerUber\":{\"bgColor\":\"cca9aa\",\"height\":1080,\"textColor1\":\"12182c\",\"textColor2\":\"19182c\",\"textColor3\":\"2f2f42\",\"textColor4\":\"352f42\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features112/v4/33/8a/c1/338ac10f-b59c-e1a1-6deb-af53a95f859d/debe4a9c-3bd8-483b-b7a0-0d896f88fcd1.png/{w}x{h}sr.{f}\",\"width\":4320},\"brandLogo\":{\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"height\":1080,\"textColor1\":\"f2f2f2\",\"textColor2\":\"e5e5e5\",\"textColor3\":\"c1c1c1\",\"textColor4\":\"b7b7b7\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features116/v4/31/ed/0b/31ed0bc0-e686-add2-cce7-3fda494d0984/51883c2e-f530-4ea9-81da-8cd5059fe433.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1080},\"contentIconTrimmed\":{\"bgColor\":\"565b60\",\"height\":1080,\"textColor1\":\"f6f6f7\",\"textColor2\":\"eeeeef\",\"textColor3\":\"d6d7d8\",\"textColor4\":\"cfd1d2\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features126/v4/65/41/e7/6541e712-8b83-d508-d7d9-d3aa0e1a1587/48ea4906-d589-4a63-bd8f-303e0ab31b62.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":752},\"contentIconTrimmedMonochrome\":{\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"height\":1080,\"textColor1\":\"f2f2f2\",\"textColor2\":\"e5e5e5\",\"textColor3\":\"c1c1c1\",\"textColor4\":\"b7b7b7\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features126/v4/3b/4c/3a/3b4c3a0e-ef75-c62a-4d37-fef9fb40d32a/348534c3-7a59-4176-bc29-dad788ebade7.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":752}},\"editorialNotes\":{\"tagline\":\"Challenge your friends!\"},\"hasInAppPurchases\":true,\"hasMessagesExtension\":false,\"hasSafariExtension\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"isDeliveredInIOSAppForWatchOS\":false,\"isHiddenFromSpringboard\":false,\"isStandaloneForWatchOS\":false,\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isXROSCompatible\":true,\"messagesScreenshots\":{},\"minimumMacOSVersion\":\"11.0\",\"minimumXROSVersion\":\"1.0\",\"offers\":[{\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":289504256}],\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1544887147\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=876691700\",\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"price\":0,\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"priceString\":\"0.00\",\"type\":\"get\"},{\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":289504256}],\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1544887147\u0026pricingParameters=SWUPD\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=876691700\",\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"price\":0,\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"priceString\":\"0.00\",\"type\":\"update\"}],\"privacyPolicyUrl\":\"https://www.yallaokey101.com/term/EN/TermOfService.html?TermsOfService\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-02-09\",\"requiredCapabilitiesForRealityDevice\":\"arm64 \",\"requires32bit\":false,\"requiresGameController\":false,\"subtitle\":\"Play Party Game with Friends!\",\"supportURLForLanguage\":\"https://www.yallaokey101.com/\",\"versionHistory\":[{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-09-04\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Spectator: Watch your friends' poker games, toggle on and off in settings.\\r\\n2. Check-in Optimization: More sign-in rewards and bonuses.\\r\\n3. Double elimination tournament mode: You will be eliminated only after failing twice.\\r\\n4. In-Room Interactive Games: Added a gift counter and countdown feature.\\r\\n5. Room Event Posting: Create an event and notify friends.\\r\\n6. Surprise Gifts: Receive extra rare gifts.\\r\\n7. Piggy Bank Event: Active play at room administrator level and above will be rewarded with gems.\\r\\n8. Slot Machine Skin: Changed to an Animal Party theme.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-09-04T13:56:12Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2.9.0\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-17\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Team Advanced Mode: Teammates can view each other's cards and exchange cards~\\r\\n2. Racing Sprint: More exciting racing sprint activities.\\r\\n3. Chat Room Mall: Unique numbers and more cool outfits.\\r\\n4. Room Microphone Positions: Add 15 Microphone Mode~\\r\\n5. Escape Penalty: Escape without reason will also be punished by suspension!\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-06-17T07:03:17Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2.8.0\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-04-01\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Intimacy: Get exclusive link effects between friends~\\r\\n2. Recall: Recall friends to get rewards~\\r\\n3. Treasure box optimization: Open treasure boxes more quickly.\\r\\n4. Task optimization: Get all rewards with one click.\\r\\n5. Game optimization: More game effects.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-04-01T01:50:57Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2.7.0\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-02-18\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1.Bug fixes and performance improvements.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-02-18T01:55:47Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2.6.2\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-02-11\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Bug fixes and performance improvements.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-02-11T08:16:29Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2.6.1\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-01-21\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Club system: Meet like-minded friends and play games together.\\r\\nWeekly and monthly cards: Buy once, receive rewards every day, discount optimization, generous rewards.\\r\\nPay special attention to friends: turn on notifications, and never miss messages from friends~\\r\\nChat system optimization: Quickly invite friends to form a group, and chat within the group.\\r\\nGem first recharge : Extra rewards for first recharge\\r\\nChat room personal settings optimization: Support modifying information on the profile page\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-01-21T10:19:57Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2.6.0\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-12-05\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1.Fixed the problem of abnormal reward collection in the task system\\r\\n2.Bug fixes and performance improvements.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-12-05T10:23:37Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2.5.1\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-11-14\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. New ranking competition: more competitive ranks are waiting for you to compete.\\r\\n2. New task system: simpler tasks, richer rewards.\\r\\n3. New treasure chest system: treasure chests are opened as soon as they are obtained, and the rewards are more generous.\\r\\n4. Medal system optimization: more dazzling medals, more levels.\\r\\n5. New room PK gameplay: you can team up in the room to PK and send gifts.\\r\\n6. New types of gifts: new naming and custom gift gameplay, come and experience it.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-11-14T01:31:20Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2.5.0\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-10-15\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1.Bug fixes and performance improvements.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-10-15T01:57:44Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2.4.5\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-09-26\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1.Fixed the issue that the app cannot be opened during watermelon activities\\r\\n2.Bug fixes and performance improvements.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-09-26T01:41:44Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2.4.4\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-09-13\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1.Fix some voice issues\\r\\n2.Fix chat history anomalies\\r\\n3.Bug fixes and performance improvements.\\r\\n\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-09-13T01:41:35Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2.4.3\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-08-31\",\"releaseNotes\":\"2.4.0 Version Update\\r\\n1. Royal Rights Upgrade: More royal rights are waiting for you to experience!\\r\\n2. Novice Guidance Optimization: A simpler and more detailed novice guidance allows you to quickly get started with the game!\\r\\n3. Duel Mode Optimization: More multiple duel modes.\\r\\n4. 1 To 1 Chat: Match chat, making it easier to get friends.\\r\\n5. Royal users, please go to your profile page to check the new special effects in your backpack！\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-08-31T02:13:55Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2.4.1\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-06-27\",\"releaseNotes\":\"2.3.0 Version Update\\r\\n1. Main interface module update: New team mode added, come and experience it with your friends!\\r\\n2. Quick Start Settings: Quick Start now allows you to set up the corresponding configuration yourself.\\r\\n3. Banning penalty: New banning penalty has been added. Those who entrust and abandon red dots and wild cards during the game will be banned!\\r\\n4. Wealth level optimization: add more level privileges!\\r\\n5. Easter Egg Gifts: Giving multiple gifts has a chance to trigger the Easter Egg Gift animation.\\r\\n6. Photo Wall: The profile page of the chat room can also display the photo wall\\r\\n7. Bugs fixed and performance improved.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-06-27T03:04:45Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2.3.0\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-05-15\",\"releaseNotes\":\"2.2.2 Version Update\\n\\r1. Bug fixes and performance improvements.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-05-15T10:33:17Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2.2.2\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-05-14\",\"releaseNotes\":\"2.2.1 Version Update\\r\\n1. Optimization of the card loading operation in the game: The card loading operation of the new version of the card game has been adjusted to make card loading more convenient!\\r\\n2. Bug fixes and performance improvements.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-05-14T01:26:58Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2.2.1\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-03-21\",\"releaseNotes\":\"2.2.0 Version Update\\n1. New Table Layout: New version of the table layout is online, you can switch between the old and new version freely, come and experience it now!\\n2. Skin Fragment Revision: Brand new universal skin fragment synthesis is online, come and get your favorite skin!\\n3. Flying Gift Optimization: Cooler flying gift effects is online, come and experience it now! \\n4. Microphone Layout Pattern: Brand new microphone layout pattern is online, takes your experience to new heights!\\n5.Bug fixes and performance improvements.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-03-21T01:45:07Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2.2.0\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-02-06\",\"releaseNotes\":\"2.1.1 Version Update\\r\\n1. Chat Room Weekly Report: Push the latest data report of your chat room to you every week.\\r\\n2. Bugs fixed and performance improved.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-02-06T06:48:58Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2.1.1\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-01-03\",\"releaseNotes\":\"2.1 Version Update\\r\\n1. New Card Comparison: more exciting gameplay, come and experience it now!\\r\\n2. Mall Optimization: new version of store interface, richer mall.\\r\\n3. Advertising Optimization: richer advertising rewards.\\r\\n4. Lucky gifts: Give lucky gifts and have a chance to get generous rewards.\\r\\n5. Combo optimization: Different rating effects will appear after a combo.\\r\\n6. Welcome into the room: It can quickly and friendly welcome users who enter the room.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-01-03T01:29:44Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2.1.0\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2023-11-14\",\"releaseNotes\":\"2.0.1 Version Update：\\r\\n1. Cancel restrictions on modification of personal information.\\r\\n2.Bug fixes and performance improvements.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-11-14T01:55:06Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2.0.1\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2023-10-31\",\"releaseNotes\":\"2.0.0 Version Update：\\r\\n1. Royal Level: more noble Royal level, more rich privileges are waiting for you!\\r\\n2. Personal Profile Page Optimization: richer profile page display content.\\r\\n3. Friends System Optimization: more convenient friend system.\\r\\n4. Blacklist System: Add a blacklist function to make the game environment more comfortable.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-10-31T01:57:47Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2.0.0\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2023-10-10\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Updates:                     \\n1. Bug fixes and performance improvements.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-10-10T02:39:52Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.14.1\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2023-09-27\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Updates:\\n1. Game interface with higher quality , more enjoyable game experience！                                  \\n2. Bug fixes and performance improvements.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-09-27T06:04:41Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.14.0\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2023-09-20\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Updates:\\r\\nBug fixes and performance improvements.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-09-20T01:48:41Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.13.4\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2023-08-23\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Updates:\\r\\nBug fixes and performance improvements.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-08-23T07:41:14Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.13.2\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2023-08-15\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Updates:\\r\\nBug fixes and performance improvements.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-08-15T02:15:53