\",\"textColor2\":\"dba362\",\"textColor3\":\"cfae7b\",\"textColor4\":\"be8c53\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/51/f1/8a/51f18a43-9270-cbd8-73c0-59329d73c354/2_U6e38_U620f_U5185_U8bed_U97f31284.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1284},{\"bgColor\":\"4c3014\",\"height\":2778,\"textColor1\":\"f1c34f\",\"textColor2\":\"eeb76d\",\"textColor3\":\"d0a643\",\"textColor4\":\"cd9c5b\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/31/0e/b5/310eb5d0-86f7-ecc2-4e35-3cc094f544cf/3_U597d_U53cb_U623f-1284.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1284},{\"bgColor\":\"6e4c28\",\"height\":2778,\"textColor1\":\"efda85\",\"textColor2\":\"f8b968\",\"textColor3\":\"d5be73\",\"textColor4\":\"dca35b\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/8c/4a/de/8c4adedf-8d45-786d-10d8-c94c5d06183a/4_U88c5_U626e_U5c55_U793a-1284.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1284},{\"bgColor\":\"4b2f14\",\"height\":2778,\"textColor1\":\"f9e7b9\",\"textColor2\":\"e8deb7\",\"textColor3\":\"d6c298\",\"textColor4\":\"c9bb97\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/15/47/1a/15471a45-bab9-69af-aa4d-51618b2222fb/5_U65b0_U624b_U4efb_U52a1-1284.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1284},{\"bgColor\":\"4c3014\",\"height\":2778,\"textColor1\":\"f8d459\",\"textColor2\":\"e7c16e\",\"textColor3\":\"d5b34c\",\"textColor4\":\"c8a45c\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/75/61/96/7561960d-b844-e1da-4583-ecfce396ace8/6_U901a_U884c_U8bc1-1284.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1284},{\"bgColor\":\"4c2f14\",\"height\":2778,\"textColor1\":\"edc165\",\"textColor2\":\"dea241\",\"textColor3\":\"cda455\",\"textColor4\":\"c18b38\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/52/15/de/5215de9d-5f2a-9a5b-42d9-1fc3a3317d04/7_U6392_U884c_U6bb5_U4f4d-1284.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1284},{\"bgColor\":\"dfc789\",\"height\":2778,\"textColor1\":\"221509\",\"textColor2\":\"312416\",\"textColor3\":\"473822\",\"textColor4\":\"54442d\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/2f/4f/75/2f4f75c8-2a09-0ba4-9118-86241138d969/8_U597d_U53cb_U0026_U4e2a_U4eba_U4fe1_U606f-1284.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1284}]},\"customVideoPreviewsByType\":{}}}},\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Welcome to Yalla Jackaroo! - The ORIGINAL Jackaroo Game!\\n\\nJump into the ORIGINAL Jackaroo experience where tradition meets modern fun! Play like a KING, chat with friends, and dominate the Jackaroo world. Yalla - let's game!\\n\\nWhy pick Yalla Jackaroo?\\nReal vibes: Feel the original feeling of offline games with real-time voice chat \u0026 interactive emojis!\\nMultiple Game Modes: Quick, 1v1, Crazy, Complex or Basic - Rich and fun game modes! Let you experience a different Jackaroo game in Yalla Jackaroo!\\nAmazing Rewards: Free coins, daily rewards, Pass rewards, and more—real gifts are waiting for you!\\nGlory Rankings: Exclusive Jackaroo honors just for you! Climb the Wealth Rank, XP Rank, and more! Earn medals and honors that show the world your true king-level skills.\\nExquisite Design: Every detail is carefully crafted to deliver a king-level visual experience.\\n\\nWhat Makes Us Special?\\nBeginner-Friendly: New to Jackaroo? Our tutorials make you a top player fast! Master king-level skills in no time!\\nLive Matching: Play Jackaroo with global players, chat while you play, double the fun in one game.\\nSocial Play: Team up with friends, create private rooms, and enjoy voice chat – perfect for online hangouts!\\nRoyal Privileges: Unlock exclusive status symbols and rare privileges. Showcase your nobility and enjoy a distinguished gaming experience.\\n\\nParty\\nGrab your mic, join the conversation, and dive into lively chat! Show off your charm, meet new friends, and enjoy free real-time multiplayer voice chat! Ready to rule the chat? Be the King of Social!\\n\\n\\nDownload Yalla Jackaroo NOW!\\nYalla Jackaroo - The ORIGINAL game for KING-level fun! Begin your legendary journey! Play Like a King, we look forward to meeting you! \\n\\nContact Us:\\nEmail: jackaroo.support@yalla.com\\nFacebook \u0026 TikTok: Yalla Jackaroo - يلا جاكارو\"},\"editorialArtwork\":{\"brandLogo\":{\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"height\":1080,\"textColor1\":\"f2f2f2\",\"textColor2\":\"e5e5e5\",\"textColor3\":\"c1c1c1\",\"textColor4\":\"b7b7b7\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features116/v4/31/ed/0b/31ed0bc0-e686-add2-cce7-3fda494d0984/51883c2e-f530-4ea9-81da-8cd5059fe433.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1080},\"contentIconTrimmed\":{\"bgColor\":\"565b60\",\"height\":1080,\"textColor1\":\"f6f6f7\",\"textColor2\":\"eeeeef\",\"textColor3\":\"d6d7d8\",\"textColor4\":\"cfd1d2\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features126/v4/65/41/e7/6541e712-8b83-d508-d7d9-d3aa0e1a1587/48ea4906-d589-4a63-bd8f-303e0ab31b62.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":752},\"contentIconTrimmedMonochrome\":{\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"height\":1080,\"textColor1\":\"f2f2f2\",\"textColor2\":\"e5e5e5\",\"textColor3\":\"c1c1c1\",\"textColor4\":\"b7b7b7\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features126/v4/3b/4c/3a/3b4c3a0e-ef75-c62a-4d37-fef9fb40d32a/348534c3-7a59-4176-bc29-dad788ebade7.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":752}},\"hasInAppPurchases\":true,\"hasMessagesExtension\":false,\"hasSafariExtension\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"isDeliveredInIOSAppForWatchOS\":false,\"isHiddenFromSpringboard\":false,\"isStandaloneForWatchOS\":false,\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isXROSCompatible\":true,\"messagesScreenshots\":{},\"minimumMacOSVersion\":\"11.0\",\"minimumXROSVersion\":\"1.0\",\"offers\":[{\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":201286656}],\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=6737796366\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=878502611\",\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"price\":0,\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"priceString\":\"0.00\",\"type\":\"get\"},{\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":201286656}],\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=6737796366\u0026pricingParameters=SWUPD\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=878502611\",\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"price\":0,\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"priceString\":\"0.00\",\"type\":\"update\"}],\"privacyPolicyUrl\":\"https://www.yallajackaroo.com/agreements/en/privacy.html\",\"releaseDate\":\"2025-01-27\",\"requiredCapabilitiesForRealityDevice\":\"arm64 gamekit metal \",\"requires32bit\":false,\"requiresGameController\":false,\"subtitle\":\"Jackaroo game with voice chat\",\"supportURLForLanguage\":\"https://www.yallajackaroo.com/\",\"versionHistory\":[{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-10-01\",\"releaseNotes\":\"[v1.1.5.2 Update]\\n1. The Royal Level makes its grand entrance – the moment to showcase your status has arrived!\\n2. Game experience optimization.\\n3. Bug fixes.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-10-01T10:23:01Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.5.2\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-09-24\",\"releaseNotes\":\"[v1.1.5.1 Update]\\n1. The Royal Level makes its grand entrance – the moment to showcase your status has arrived!\\n2. Game experience optimization.\\n3. Bug fixes.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-09-24T05:52:31Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.5.1\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-09-02\",\"releaseNotes\":\"[v1.1.5 Update]\\n1. New game modes have been added to the VIP Room – let the fun begin!\\n2. Expand your room's badge collection and acquire new badges to decorate your display case!\\n3. Game experience optimization.\\n4. Bug fixes.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-09-02T06:47:59Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.5\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-08-12\",\"releaseNotes\":\"[v1.1.4.1 Update]\\n1. New badges have been added, come and collect them!\\n2. Now you can share the Chat Room with friends in Messages. Try it with your friends.\\n3. Game experience optimization.\\n4. Bug fixes.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-08-12T02:53:03Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.4.1\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-07-29\",\"releaseNotes\":\"[v1.1.4 Update]\\n1. Daily Rewards revamp: new Treasure Hunt gameplay, come and challenge your eyesight!\\n2. Game experience optimization.\\n3. Bug fixes.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-07-29T02:06:08Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.4\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-07-08\",\"releaseNotes\":\"[v1.1.3.1 Update]\\n1. Added 1v1 mode, let's experience a more exciting Jackaroo game together!\\n2. Added XP Ranking, try to become the most experienced Jackaroo player.\\n3. Added Badge. Unlock and wear badges to show your strength.\\n4. Add more cool game effects, come and explore in the game!\\n5. Game experience optimization.\\n6. Bug fixes.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-07-08T01:52:37Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.3.1\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-23\",\"releaseNotes\":\"[v1.1.3 Update]\\n1. Combat Ranking: Record your brilliant moments of fierce struggle!\\n2. Game experience optimization.\\n3. Bug fixes.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-06-23T08:55:29Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.3\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-05\",\"releaseNotes\":\"[v1.1.2.3 Update]\\n1. Quick Mode: Experience the Faster-Paced jackaroo gameplay now!\\n2. Optimize the Game Guide.\\n3. Optimize the experience of Pass.\\n4. bug fixes.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-06-05T01:53:02Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.2.3\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-03\",\"releaseNotes\":\"[v1.1.2.2 Update]\\n1. Quick Mode: Experience the Faster-Paced jackaroo gameplay now!\\n2. Optimize the Game Guide.\\n3. Optimize the experience of Pass.\\n4. bug fixes.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-06-03T01:42:59Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.2.2\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-05-22\",\"releaseNotes\":\"[v1.1.2.1 Update]\\n1. Quick Mode: Experience the Faster-Paced jackaroo gameplay now!\\n2. Optimizations and bug fixes.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-05-22T02:13:16Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.2.1\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-05-21\",\"releaseNotes\":\"[v1.1.2 Update]\\n1. Quick Mode: Experience the Faster-Paced jackaroo gameplay now!\\n2. Optimizations and bug fixes.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-05-21T05:35:19Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.2\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-04-26\",\"releaseNotes\":\"[v1.1.1 Update]\\n1. Daily Tasks: Complete tasks to earn coins.\\n2. Level Rewards: Coins, diamonds, and skins are waiting for you.\\n3. Optimizations and bug fixes.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-04-26T07:43:29Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.1\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-03-29\",\"releaseNotes\":\"[v1.1.0.1 Update]\\n\\n1. Chat Room: Talk and play with friends in real-time!\\n2. Quick Mode: Faster, more intense action!\\n3. VIP Rooms: Battle it out with the best players worldwide!\\n4. Optimizations and bug fixes.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-03-29T08:15:41Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.0.1\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-03-25\",\"releaseNotes\":\"[v1.1.0 Update]\\n\\n1. Chat Room: Talk and play with friends in real-time!\\n2. Quick Mode: Faster, more intense action!\\n3. VIP Rooms: Battle it out with the best players worldwide!\\n4. Optimizations and bug fixes.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-03-25T01:41:32Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.0\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-01-27\",\"releaseNotes\":null,\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-01-27T15:07:38Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.0\"}],\"videoPreviewsByType\":{},\"websiteUrl\":\"https://www.yallajackaroo.com/\"}},\"privacy\":{\"privacyTypes\":[{\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"User Content\",\"identifier\":\"USER_CONTENT\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Identifiers\",\"identifier\":\"IDENTIFIERS\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Diagnostics\",\"identifier\":\"DIAGNOSTICS\"}],\"description\":\"The following data may be collected and linked to your identity:\",\"identifier\":\"DATA_LINKED_TO_YOU\",\"privacyType\":\"Data Linked to You\"},{\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"Identifiers\",\"identifier\":\"IDENTIFIERS\"}],\"description\":\"The following data may be collected but it is not linked to your identity:\",\"identifier\":\"DATA_NOT_LINKED_TO_YOU\",\"privacyType\":\"Data Not Linked to You\"}]},\"requirementsByDeviceFamily\":{\"ipad\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPad\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iPadOS 13.0 or later.\"},\"iphone\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPhone\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 13.0 or later.\"},\"ipod\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPod touch\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 13.0 or later.\"},\"mac\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"Mac\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires macOS 11.0 or later and a Mac with Apple M1 chip or later.\"},\"realityDevice\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"Apple Vision\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires visionOS 1.0 or later.\"}},\"reviewsRestricted\":false,\"supportsArcade\":false,\"supportsStreamlinedBuy\":true,\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/yalla-jackaroo-classic/id6737796366\",\"userRating\":{\"ariaLabelForRatings\":\"4.6 stars\",\"ratingCount\":98,\"ratingCountList\":[5,1,4,7,81],\"value\":4.6}},\"relationships\":{\"developer\":{\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/6737796366/developer?l=en-US\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"1444567250\",\"type\":\"developers\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/developers/1444567250?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"editorialArtwork\":{\"bannerUber\":{\"bgColor\":\"65dbcf\",\"height\":1080,\"textColor1\":\"081110\",\"textColor2\":\"081110\",\"textColor3\":\"1a3936\",\"textColor4\":\"1a3936\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features116/v4/0a/5d/94/0a5d949b-23eb-d333-dbed-69805e02936e/3358e551-817e-4d31-9c3d-7ab84479420b.png/{w}x{h}sr.{f}\",\"width\":4320}},\"genreNames\":[],\"mediaType\":\"Mobile Software Applications\",\"name\":\"Yalla Technology FZ-LLC\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/developer/yalla-technology-fz-llc/id1444567250\"}}]},\"genres\":{\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/6737796366/genres?l=en-US\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"6014\",\"type\":\"genres\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/genres/6014?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"name\":\"Games\",\"parentId\":\"36\",\"parentName\":\"App Store\",\"url\":\"https://itunes.apple.com/us/genre/id6014\"}},{\"id\":\"7009\",\"type\":\"genres\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/genres/7009?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"name\":\"Family\",\"parentId\":\"6014\",\"parentName\":\"Games\",\"url\":\"https://itunes.apple.com/us/genre/id7009\"}},{\"id\":\"7004\",\"type\":\"genres\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/genres/7004?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"name\":\"Board\",\"parentId\":\"6014\",\"parentName\":\"Games\",\"url\":\"https://itunes.apple.com/us/genre/id7004\"}}]}},\"meta\":{\"contentVersion\":{\"MZ_INDEXER\":1760427930396,\"RTCI\":1761081192123}}}]},\"genres\":{\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/1091902866/genres?l=en-US\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"6016\",\"type\":\"genres\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/genres/6016?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"name\":\"Entertainment\",\"parentId\":\"36\",\"parentName\":\"App Store\",\"url\":\"https://itunes.apple.com/us/genre/id6016\"}},{\"id\":\"6005\",\"type\":\"genres\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/genres/6005?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"name\":\"Social Networking\",\"parentId\":\"36\",\"parentName\":\"App Store\",\"url\":\"https://itunes.apple.com/us/genre/id6005\"}}]},\"merchandised-in-apps\":{\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/1091902866/merchandised-in-apps?l=en-US\",\"data\":[]},\"related-editorial-items\":{\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/1091902866/related-editorial-items?l=en-US\",\"data\":[]},\"reviews\":{\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/1091902866/reviews?l=en-US\",\"next\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/1091902866/reviews?l=en-US\u0026offset=10\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"5750138391\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2020-04-02T09:36:34Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"body\":\"Hello dear! We are happy to be with you in Yalla. Yalla is an original application that allows you to meet new friends from around the Arab world. We hope that your next comment will also be five stars. If you have suggestions, you can contact yallasupport@yalla.live.\",\"id\":14552798,\"modified\":\"2020-04-09T01:42:46Z\"},\"isEdited\":false,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I’ve been using this app for a good amount of time , my experience has been superb so far👌👌. After joining in yalla,  everyone welcomed me like a family and I became one of them eventually. Here, I’ve been talking to different people, making friends, playing games , earning gifts and doing many other lucrative  activities. This app has made my online time worthwhile. ❤️❤️\",\"title\":\"A big shout-out to yalla\",\"userName\":\"Frenkie'10\"}},{\"id\":\"4284196784\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2019-06-08T15:22:46Z\",\"isEdited\":false,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"If you asked questions nobody would answer, they would just say random things over and over again. The viewers would just do nothing. If I asked if they were real there would be not 1 comment. If there was a comment it wasn’t even related to what I was talking about. I don’t recommend getting this app.\",\"title\":\"Unprofessional\",\"userName\":\"Jomara Blenkharn\"}},{\"id\":\"5749915856\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2020-04-02T08:32:32Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"body\":\"Hi, most users (more than 99%) enjoy Yalla for free and they love to have fun with many friends together. Let us work together to develop Yalla to be the best Arab community for our brothers and sisters. If you have any suggestions, you can contact yallasupport@yalla.live and we hope to see your distinguished comment with the five stars. Thank you!\",\"id\":14646972,\"modified\":\"2020-04-14T05:29:30Z\"},\"isEdited\":false,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I’m using this app since last couple of months and I just forgot other apps for time pass. honestly I found a lot of good friends here and in party time I feel like I’m in a party house. just awesome. strongly recommending for all.... 😍😍\",\"title\":\"yalla is my favourite app since last few months..\",\"userName\":\"crowwwn\"}},{\"id\":\"4290748067\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2019-06-09T18:21:14Z\",\"isEdited\":false,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I enjoy moco several times daily. The poker rooms have live interaction with other players and I even got a date ... occasional glitches that seem to be worked out whenever noticed ... but overall worth it. It's a complex of various social games and media .. mostly uncensored I believe ...\",\"title\":\"Love the app! but suggestions\",\"userName\":\"Levertis Tregunnah\"}},{\"id\":\"4286221241\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2019-06-09T01:35:33Z\",\"isEdited\":false,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"So I got this app 2 years ago and I registered my phone number In. I now have TikTok and I can’t add my number in because it’s in here. (I’m guessing the two apps are related somehow) and I’ve tried to delete my number and log out of this app but it never works. Don’t get this app if you are planning on getting TikTok\",\"title\":\"Great App!!\",\"userName\":\"Kennieth Kemish\"}},{\"id\":\"3191417700\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2018-09-15T09:41:47Z\",\"isEdited\":false,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The best app I ever had I love it so much I would like if the make the coins cheaper a woke up in this app and I a go to sleep to so I feel this app it’s my life and I would like them to see the people who’s charge in this to be special thanks\",\"title\":\"My lovely app\",\"userName\":\"Maha abd\"}},{\"id\":\"6107935027\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2020-06-22T11:33:15Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"body\":\"Dear users:Please check whether your device allows Yalla to run. If the above problem still exists, please send relevant screenshots to feedback, thank you!\",\"id\":16154760,\"modified\":\"2020-06-23T01:32:49Z\"},\"isEdited\":false,\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I'm using this app since 3years on my ipad mini but from last week yalla is not working on my ipad I reinstalled the app and also reset my ipad but still doesn't work. When i open yalla suddenly it's shutdown and after that when i open yalla it is ask me to login again. Everything is working perfectly fine on my iPad rather than yalla. And also on my other phone yalla is working perfectly fine. Please solve my problem. Thank you\",\"title\":\"Not working on ipad mini\",\"userName\":\"Farwai009\"}},{\"id\":\"5817411675\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2020-04-16T00:31:21Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"body\":\"Dear user, we apologize for what happened to you, we will verify and deal with what you said, Yalla is committed to establishing a standardized and fair customer service team, thank you for your love for yalla, we will do our best Create a beautiful environment for you ~\",\"id\":14626098,\"modified\":\"2020-04-13T09:11:56Z\"},\"isEdited\":true,\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Yalla is really awkward application i am sending emails from 10 days that i have one issue in hindi region but hindi region owner Lost Atlantis and CS Arif Sarkar bangali they disturb whole hindi regoin but no one take action against both of them i am using this application since 156.\\nPlease don't install this app yalla technology say 99% users are saying about application but they are telling a lie with public.\\nResolve my issue then give your comment of this post on playstore\",\"title\":\"complantlaint against lost atlantis and arif sarkar\",\"userName\":\"55873785\"}},{\"id\":\"4272806698\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2019-06-06T14:05:34Z\",\"isEdited\":false,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love this app because I can face time my friend when she has a kindle and I have a iPhone 6s! We play games and draw on each other and send pictures! Love it so much\",\"title\":\"U should read this\",\"userName\":\"Gagik Kollatsch\"}},{\"id\":\"3907455109\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2019-03-21T10:24:35Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"body\":\"Dear user, thank you for your feedback. Google closed its login method, so we can't log in by G-Mail. We have notified all users last month. You can try to sign in with phone number, facebook, ins or other ways in APP. More datails please contact with yallasupport@yalla.live. And appreciate if you can change to be five-star.\",\"id\":7872506,\"modified\":\"2019-03-24T06:47:24Z\"},\"isEdited\":false,\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I am now creating a new account because I can’t sign in into my real account which is connected through my email address. What are you going to do about the people who already have their account leveled up and spent so much money to get coins and upgrade their room. You don’t expect them to create another account after their hard hard work to upgrade their accounts, right?\",\"title\":\"GET BACK THE EMAIL LOGIN ICON !\",\"userName\":\"Nas9sor\"}}]},\"top-in-apps\":{\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/1091902866/top-in-apps?l=en-US\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"1100991711\",\"type\":\"in-apps\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/in-apps/1100991711?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Purchase this item, you will get 100 Yalla Golds.\"},\"editorialArtwork\":{},\"icuLocale\":\"en_US@currency=USD\",\"isFamilyShareable\":false,\"isMerchandisedEnabled\":false,\"isMerchandisedVisibleByDefault\":false,\"isSubscription\":false,\"name\":\"100 Golds\",\"offerName\":\"com.weieyu.yalla.pro.oneDA\",\"offers\":[{\"assets\":[],\"buyParams\":\"productType=A\u0026price=990\u0026salableAdamId=1100991711\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026offerName=com.weieyu.yalla.pro.oneDA\u0026appAdamId=1091902866\",\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"price\":0.99,\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.99\",\"priceString\":\"0.99\",\"type\":\"buy\"}],\"releaseDate\":\"2009-06-17\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/100-golds/id1091902866\"}},{\"id\":\"1100998137\",\"type\":\"in-apps\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/in-apps/1100998137?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Purchase this item, you will get 1000 Yalla Golds.\"},\"editorialArtwork\":{},\"icuLocale\":\"en_US@currency=USD\",\"isFamilyShareable\":false,\"isMerchandisedEnabled\":false,\"isMerchandisedVisibleByDefault\"